  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Dzagonur_Bastion\" title=\"Dzagonur Bastion\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Dzagonur_Bastion_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Dzagonur Bastion (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Dzagonur Bastion\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dzagonur_Bastion.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dzagonur Bastion.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/8/84/Dzagonur_Bastion.jpg/196px-Dzagonur_Bastion.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/8/84/Dzagonur_Bastion.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Wilderness_of_Bahdza\" title=\"Wilderness of Bahdza\">Wilderness of Bahdza</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dzagonur_Bastion_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dzagonur Bastion world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/02/Dzagonur_Bastion_world_map.jpg/196px-Dzagonur_Bastion_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"139\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/02/Dzagonur_Bastion_world_map.jpg/294px-Dzagonur_Bastion_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/02/Dzagonur_Bastion_world_map.jpg/392px-Dzagonur_Bastion_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"712\" data-file-height=\"505\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dzagonur_Bastion_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dzagonur Bastion inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/56/Dzagonur_Bastion_inside.jpg/196px-Dzagonur_Bastion_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/56/Dzagonur_Bastion_inside.jpg/294px-Dzagonur_Bastion_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/56/Dzagonur_Bastion_inside.jpg/392px-Dzagonur_Bastion_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Dzagonur Bastion</b> is the militaristic frontier outpost of <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a> under the rule of <a href=\"/wiki/Prince_Ahmtur_the_Mighty\" title=\"Prince Ahmtur the Mighty\">Prince Ahmtur the Mighty</a>.\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>The gateway to the mighty <a href=\"/wiki/Citadel_of_Dzagon\" title=\"Citadel of Dzagon\">Citadel of Dzagon</a>, the <b>Bastion</b> is a hub of activity for mercenaries, recruiters, and merchants of arms and armor. Locals are more than willing to sell you any manner of implements for wounding, killing, and maiming, as well as the armor to deflect other adventurer's <small>[<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Sic\"><span title=\"w:Sic\"><i>sic</i></span></a>]</small> purchases.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests_available\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests available</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Crafters\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Crafters</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Merchants_and_traders\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Merchants and traders</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Other_services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other services</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If you have selected <a href=\"/wiki/Master_of_Whispers\" title=\"Master of Whispers\">Master of Whispers</a> over <a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Calling_the_Order\" title=\"Calling the Order\">Calling the Order</a> will conclude here.\n</p><p>This outpost lies at the northeastern corner of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">the Mirror of Lyss</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a> (west)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wilderness_of_Bahdza\" title=\"Wilderness of Bahdza\">Wilderness of Bahdza</a> (east)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_available\">Quests available</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Quests available\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Commander_Tanmod\" title=\"Commander Tanmod\">Commander Tanmod</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interception\" title=\"Interception\">Interception</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/For_Your_Ears_Only\" title=\"For Your Ears Only\">For Your Ears Only</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lieutenant_Murunda\" title=\"Lieutenant Murunda\">Lieutenant Murunda</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/A_Sound_of_Ancient_Horns\" title=\"A Sound of Ancient Horns\">A Sound of Ancient Horns</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_the_Harpies\" title=\"Destroy the Harpies\">Destroy the Harpies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Extinction\" title=\"Extinction\">Extinction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Search_for_Survivors\" title=\"The Search for Survivors\">The Search for Survivors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reclaiming_the_Temple\" title=\"Reclaiming the Temple\">Reclaiming the Temple</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Crafters\">Crafters</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Crafters\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisseh\" title=\"Wisseh\">Wisseh</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Weaponsmith\" title=\"Weaponsmith\">weaponsmith</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class